                        "entry_id": "de3a041f-c074-325b-b9f4-54df6e903a31",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Yellow or orange-yellow water-soluble compound, a member of the vitamin B complex, that acts as a growth-promoting factor in humans and other animals."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
